secubox-waf (1.2.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * New endpoint GET /bans/history?hours=N&limit=M (ref #498) :
    aggregates waf-threats.log per source IP within the window,
    cross-references the active CrowdSec decision set, returns
    {count, severity_max, first_seen, last_seen, top_categories,
    sample_path, currently_banned}. Handles both mitm WAF format
    (client_ip) and in-process WAF format (ip).
  * Frontend www/waf/index.html : new 'Tracked Attackers (24 h)'
    glass-card after the existing Visitors/Vhosts cards. Table of
    top 30 IPs with state (🚫 silenced / 👁️ tracked-only), severity,
    top categories, first/last seen — operator's 'silence but track'
    view.

